From 23fb80c5ba57b24e4e4ebb42a39a026833308259 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Project Luma <builds@project-luma.local>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:02:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 21/23] ASoC: codecs: add FourSemi FS18xx/FS19xx amplifiers

The FourSemi frsm amplifier framework from the vendor tree, with the
digital FS1816/FS1832/FS1838 (fs18v1) and FS19xx (fs19v2, device id
0x05) operations added: reset, register tables and DSP model/effect
tables from the frsm firmware, PLL and sample rate from the I2S bit
clock, start-up, mute and volume. The FS19xx starts at -12 dB
(amp_volume) and exports a volume setter for the machine driver.
